{"step_index":295,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T02:30:16Z","thinking":"**Constructing Error Correction**\n\nI'm currently building a Python script to create an accurate mapping table for business registration numbers. My goal is to correct all 42 erroneous numbers and then apply the final orange highlight as shown in the mockup to complete the final output. The progress is going well.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Build comprehensive correction mapping for all 42 error businesses.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import json\nimport re\n\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\resolved_biz_numbers.json', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    items = json.load(f)\n\ndef validate_biz_no(val):\n    clean = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', str(val))\n    if len(clean) != 10:\n        return False, clean\n    weights = [1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5]\n    digits = [int(c) for c in clean]\n    s = sum(digits[i] * weights[i] for i in range(8))\n    s += (digits[8] * 5) // 10 + (digits[8] * 5) % 10\n    chk = (10 - (s % 10)) % 10\n    return digits[9] == chk, clean\n\ncorrections = {}\n\nfor it in items:\n    name = it['name']\n    old_b = it['old_bno']\n    new_b = it['new_bno']\n    \n    # Manual overrides for confirmed ground truths\n    if '대성이앤지' in name:\n        new_b = '606-86-35543'\n    elif '진영노즐' in name:\n        new_b = '421-88-00340'\n    elif '토마토전자' in name:\n        new_b = '605-81-62528'\n    elif '삼성지투비' in name:\n        new_b = '605-81-74690' # 6085817469 -> 605-81-74690 (부산진구 법인번호 180111-0536061)\n    elif '화산' in name:\n        new_b = '606-81-89311' # 6068189316 -> 6068189311 (기장군 기장읍 청강로74번길 50)\n    elif '원광전열' in name:\n        new_b = '606-36-98782' # 6063698788 -> 6063698782 (강서구 유통단지1로57번길 34)\n    elif '비엔아이' in name:\n        new_b = '606-37-39691' # 부산 북구/사상구 비엔아이\n        \n    clean_new = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', str(new_b))\n    is_val, _ = validate_biz_no(clean_new)\n    \n    corrections[name] = {\n        'old_bno': old_b,\n        'new_bno': clean_new,\n        'new_bno_fmt': f\"{clean_new[:3]}-{clean_new[3:5]}-{clean_new[5:]}\" if len(clean_new) == 10 else clean_new,\n        'valid': is_val\n    }\n\nprint(f\"Total mapped corrections: {len(corrections)}\")\ninvalid_count = sum(1 for c in corrections.values() if not c['valid'])\nprint(f\"Invalid count after correction: {invalid_count}\")\n\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\final_biz_corrections.json', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(corrections, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n\nfor k, v in corrections.items():\n    print(f\"{k:25s} | 기존:{v['old_bno']:10s} -> 수정:{v['new_bno_fmt']:12s} (체크섬검증:{v['valid']})\")\n","Description":"Build final biz corrections","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\build_final_corrections.py","toolAction":"Building corrections","toolSummary":"Run build_final_corrections.py"}}]}
